{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_08_end",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_08",
  "title": "渗透作战",
  "storyCode": "OD-8",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_08_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a9ba283ba3a8a3527da1772fb7bacf24de0f7bb2c5c4cb2ea74d3d39dfb4b03f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "这东西还在动！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "炸弹部署完了，我们得撤了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "它......好像在重生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "这东西......到底算什么生物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "灰烬",
      "text": "不管它是什么，这东西都不应该存在于这个世界上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "闪击",
      "text": "我们得撤了，要赶在炸弹爆炸之前跑出去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "走这边！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我没子弹了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "巡林者？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "我还在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "你的情况看起来可不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "老了，老了......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "你的手怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "刚才没躲开，小问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "现在怎么办？要去避难所吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "矿洞那边，还没消息吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "没有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "老夫也没想到我们能坚持这么久......不过也快到极限了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "你在干什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "弄一面盾牌，我其实早想这么试试了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哈哈哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "这就像是回到了过去，那些有关荣耀的美好时光。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "年轻的巡林者们集结在镇子的入口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "明知道大军压境，明知道在战争之后他们中很多人都会血洒这片荒地之上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "但是他们有说有笑，高呼着战歌，仿佛敌人是不堪一击的虫豸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "战争残忍无情，有人退缩了，更多人决定死守到底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "倒下的人成为了传奇，站着的人负责铭记他们的一切。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "最后站着的那个人，也慢慢开始畏惧死亡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "因为他不想忘记那些倒下的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哈哈哈......也许是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "很荣幸和你并肩作战，亚历山大。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我也很荣幸，巡林者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "不要这么悲观，我还没有放弃战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "战车",
      "text": "我就是用砸的，也要敲死几个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "等等......那是什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "是援军！哈哈哈哈哈哈！我们得救了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "这个手法......是那个年轻人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "我收到了求救信号，本来以为只是一次普通的救援任务。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "我没有想到会在这里遇到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "老游侠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "你重操旧业了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哈哈，老了老了，让你看笑话了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "你的弯刀呢，游侠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "年纪大了，早就耍不动了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "若不是你来，今天我这把老骨头怕是要交代在这里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "你谦虚了，老游侠。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "小队注意，目标在领主宅邸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "敌人是危险的变异源石生物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "随时汇报位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "当心点，它们数量很多，让你的人尽量避免落单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "还有，注意地下，它们会钻洞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "很荣幸与你并肩战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stormeye",
      "text": "“血色山谷的弯刀”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
